# Kept off the public repo deliberately.
#
# _tools/marker-reminder.gs carries all four committee email addresses, and
# firestore.rules names the founder's. Email addresses in a public GitHub
# repository are scraped within days. None of these files are needed to serve
# the map - the rules live on Firebase, the export script runs on this machine,
# and the reminder script runs in Google Apps Script.
_tools/
firestore.rules
firebase.json
.firebaserc

# Service account keys open the whole database. They should never be in this
# folder at all - it is a public repository - but if one ever lands here by
# accident, git must not carry it to GitHub.
*.json
!data/*.geojson
*-key.txt
*credentials*

# Claude's brief for this project - local notes, not part of the published map
CLAUDE.md

# working files
index.html.bak
Start Cemetery Map.bat
*.log
